00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:53.440
healthy people that are fully vaccinated.
Speaker 1: OK, so you hear it there. So the point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.440 --> 00:05:00.240
here is we would do this because it would get&nbsp;
people vaccinated when we looked at the polling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:06.080
early in the vaccine mandate discussion that was&nbsp;
required to go to a movie theater. Would that make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.200
you go and get vaccinated now? Most people said&nbsp;
no. If you got 100 bucks for getting vaccinated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.880
would that make resistant people going now?&nbsp;
Most of them wouldn't, but a requirement to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:21.760
present proof of vaccine to fly domestically,&nbsp;
something like 40 percent of those not yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:27.760
vaccinated said that would make me go and get&nbsp;
vaccinated. So if the question is, would it work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.880
it seems that it would. And it seems like it would&nbsp;
also make a very, very big impact. There's a very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:39.120
good Twitter thread from Dr. Craig Spencer,&nbsp;
who talks about all the COVID he's been seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:45.600
in the E.R. and what the cases are like on&nbsp;
the basis of vaccination status. And he says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:51.760
the patients with a third booster have&nbsp;
had mild symptoms mostly sore throat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:56.640
a ton of sore throat fatigue, muscle pain, no&nbsp;
difficulty breathing, no shortness of breath.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:01.200
The patients with two doses were still what would&nbsp;
be considered mild, but they were more fatigued.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:09.360
More fever, more coughing, more miserable, still&nbsp;
mostly OK. Those with one dose of JNJ and COVID&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:15.600
felt horrible fever for a few days or more&nbsp;
week. Tired shortness of breath cough, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:21.440
